If dashboard is inaccessible, please mark the following checklist:
1- Try to login with cleared cache and an incognito window;
2- Plugins and browser extensions can block needed URLs. Try logging in with them disabled;
3- Login from a different computer;
4- Login from outside the company network/firewall.

For more support, you could attach screenshot(s)/anther user ID with access for reference/url to dashboard/etc.

